{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0223_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c90c9026b64c10ba7bb52e2bc9caeca1ddccef5a1044c5383b8757a48a82a093", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影だ。\nテーマは『大人のパーティー』らしい……）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄写真杂志《爱格拉！！》。\n主题似乎是“成人派对”……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0223_1001_048rei", "source_sha256": "22b1e3f3f80baec80cf3c7070c7fe0c611ed654215476e303309fdaba2f75b57", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん！\nじゃじゃーん！　チャイナ服、似合いますか？", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生！\n锵锵！这身旗袍，适合我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0223_1002_p", "source_sha256": "6838dd3d297981272af064d4cbba35fe9cbbc030551850df35e2066dac093c7a", "ja": "お疲れさま。ああ、すごく似合ってるよ。\n想像以上にピッタリだったな。", "zh": "辛苦了。啊，特别适合你。\n比想象中还要合身。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0223_1003_048rei", "source_sha256": "0bfcc43a1b8db0cc569a25bae5d24b8a74893eb8724499cf55394edbcdad33eb", "ja": "ありがとうございます♪　{$P$}さん\nチャイナ服って、パーティーに着ていけるんですか？", "zh": "谢谢您♪　{$P$}先生\n旗袍也可以穿着去参加派对吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0223_1004_p", "source_sha256": "96c03c93fdc3a135bb5723960d3ae11eaa0d2a69475711b3d5341e0c59e4695d", "ja": "そうらしいな。最近は、結婚式や映画祭みたいな\nフォーマルな場所でも、着ることがあるみたいだ。", "zh": "听说是这样。最近在婚礼、电影节之类的正式场合，似乎也有人会穿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0223_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "a5c56bc94c4c30854b2156971e122d69f7b34a64ff7749d101f81d234c9178fd", "ja": "そうなんですね。いろんな場所で着られたら、\n毎日がもっともっと楽しくなりそうですね♪", "zh": "原来是这样啊。要是能在各种场合穿的话，每天一定会变得更加更加开心吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0223_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "4faad51d210f1b6fc29693ad45407f275a9cb16b871030eac82f80a2044f6386", "ja": "そうだ！\n{$P$}さん、結婚式に行きませんか？", "zh": "对了！\n{$P$}先生，要不要去参加婚礼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0223_1007_p", "source_sha256": "700ef2550bddad223968660fb6a72adac05ace3a302319f59d21d1365507882e", "ja": "結婚式？\n麗花の知り合いに、結婚する人でもいるのか？", "zh": "婚礼？丽花的熟人里，有要结婚的人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0223_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "b4e2655ac58b668e44553122a616aed1719413f5ad1f88c593f134dabeb63d8c", "ja": "どうなんでしょう？\n知り合いにはいないと思います。", "zh": "那就不知道了。\n我想我的熟人里应该没有。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0223_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "519f1565ba6bd97bbed8f6b5b13d1d3e90cefb08ebc940b056c817282b55f0f9", "ja": "あっ。{$P$}さんはどうですか？\n結婚する予定はありませんか？", "zh": "啊。{$P$}先生怎么样呢？\n有结婚的打算吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0223_1010_p", "source_sha256": "b9ca7c2f1f51b35163de136e7d17d13a228e6a3a44c7a49331150c9707eb9d85", "ja": "いや……予定はないかな。\nみんなのプロデュースで手一杯だから。", "zh": "不……目前没有这个打算吧。\n光是制作大家的偶像活动就已经忙不过来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0223_1011_048rei", "source_sha256": "5400415aeec97cd9591ae930e90db06d985536a19be4f1f4c84aa7610b5c4ffa", "ja": "そうですか……。\nそれなら、映画祭のパーティーはありませんか？", "zh": "这样啊……  \n那样的话，电影节的派对也没有吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0223_1012_p", "source_sha256": "503c455c9e41c68d9cf55fd6b3de81674a68f592092658302237e6b98fa63219", "ja": "うーん、心当たりはないけど……。\nでも麗花が映画に出演したら、行けるかもしれないな。", "zh": "嗯……我没想到有什么合适的地方，不过……\n不过要是丽花出演了电影，说不定就能去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0223_1013_048rei", "source_sha256": "3add689eabf7753e445c6d010ab818d35e2678eebffe26ff21be457c30ade7f2", "ja": "本当ですか！　この服で行ってみたいです、映画祭！\nそれじゃ、約束ですね♪", "zh": "真的吗！我想穿着这身衣服去电影节！\n那就说定了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0223_1014_048rei", "source_sha256": "958a2092554538a2bddfb48ad3c2b192d457df8eca15c9e46c0a3be635e38aed", "ja": "ゆびきりげんま～ん、\n嘘ついたら針100万本の～ますっ♪　ゆびきった！", "zh": "拉钩盖～章，\n说谎的人要吞100万根针♪　拉钩成功！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0223_1015_p", "source_sha256": "a4eaa170b35794e78c06d8b958d1490e3614a00436e8119ef95a14195e6653cb", "ja": "針、多くないか？", "zh": "针也太多了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0223_1016_048rei", "source_sha256": "90e5d2a489d9ad7c95fd0675951436c5884e834746e616b2a91bd6180e3df78e", "ja": "はいっ！　{$P$}さんには、\n特別大サービスのおまけです♪", "zh": "是的！这是给{$P$}先生的特别大赠品♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0223_1017_p", "source_sha256": "4dc8e6b799e08349d03d1ae2c95e25b7c6e4d18a47ec88624333dca1256f2a6d", "ja": "ありがとう……。とりあえず、\n映画祭に行けるような仕事をとってこないとな！", "zh": "谢谢你……总之，\n我得去接一些能参加电影节的工作才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0223_1018_048rei", "source_sha256": "1cce71b9cbbc7ca7601d91862d41dcdc613f5cd21b7b770bf483a90cc023d7f5", "ja": "その意気ですよ、{$P$}さん！\n私も負けないように、お仕事頑張ります。", "zh": "就是要有这股干劲，{$P$}先生！\n为了不输给你，我也会努力工作的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0223_1019_048rei", "source_sha256": "90fd683c8bf95f93ecb102155d8debece4589448c4b5d589c38c54f0729ba515", "ja": "あ！　撮影が始まるみたいですね。\nいってきま～す！　ゆびきりげんまん、ふふふふ～ん♪", "zh": "啊！好像要开始拍摄了。\n我出发啦～！拉钩约定，嘻嘻嘻嘻～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0223_1020_p", "source_sha256": "36bb1eb6a8262d26906e3f5c63af6cb66893d29596d7903a6145cd47cb8659cf", "ja": "（撮影は順調で、良い写真が撮れた。いつか麗花を\n映画祭に連れて行けるよう、俺も頑張らないとな！）", "zh": "（拍摄进行得很顺利，也拍到了不错的照片。为了将来有一天能带丽花去电影节，我也得努力才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
